WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:37.000
JUDAU, LAUNCH!

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:46.130
The Argama, after surviving Gottn's
attack, left Granada.

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:49.350
From there, the ship set a
course directly for Earth.

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:52.690
That's because we didn't know when
Axis was going to strike next!

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:59.240
We'd gotten intelligence that said the
Axis fleet was on the move, though.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:11.080
Thanks for coming out here, Mr. Madchar.

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:13.750
This time, I made it without
getting caught by the enemy first!

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:15.830
Getting this all the way
out here wasn't easy.

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.000
We're both acting on
orders from Granada.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.220
We do what we must.

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:23.880
It's a golden mobile suit!

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.590
How stylish!

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:29.260
It's exactly like Lieutenant
Quattro Bajenna's old Hyaku Shiki.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.930
They haven't made any changes
to the model at all.

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:34.060
Maybe I should swap over
to the Hyaku Shiki!

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:36.440
Elle, you'd look better in the Mk. II.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:39.940
You just want to pilot it yourself!

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:42.360
Saying it that way is so rude!

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:43.690
Maybe I'll pilot it?

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:45.240
You can't!

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:47.400
The problem at hand is Haman.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.070
I understand that.

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:51.710
This is data concerning Haman's fleet.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:54.300
Haman is currently aboard the Sadalahn.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:56.800
You have to stop her before
her fleet lands on Earth.

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:59.000
You want us to sink her ship?

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.790
That's right! Use the
Argama's main cannon.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:03.380
Nothing ever changes.

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:06.050
I didn't ask for your opinion.

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:08.730
I'm just relaying orders from
the AEUG's general staff office.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:12.640
The higher-ups have a
lot of faith in you.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:16.390
Even so, I can't make
the impossible happen.

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:19.170
The Argama has its Gundam Team.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:23.570
With this many Gundams, your victory
is assured! I guarantee it.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:25.710
That's not worth much.

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:27.990
What?! A bomb?!

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:29.830
Not so loud!

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:32.320
Why do you have to do stuff like this?!

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:34.240
Don't you want to get Leina back?

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:36.240
Of course I do!

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:40.120
Here! These containers are packed
to the brim with bombs.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:43.430
You can attach this to the
Double Zeta and tow it along.

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:44.920
Isn't this a great idea?

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:48.760
You've got to be kidding. The
Double Zeta would blow up along with it!

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:50.430
Don't you worry!

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:53.140
We already have a
solution for that issue.

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:58.120
If you lengthen the wire like this before letting
go, the Double Zeta will be safe even if the bomb goes off!

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:01.310
Right, right! Besides, we filled
it with plastic explosives!

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:04.480
It'd take one heck of a shock
to detonate it by accident!

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:07.440
Is that so...? I'm
still pretty skeptical.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:11.090
Is it so hard for you to have a
little bit of faith in your friends?

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:14.220
Leina... you want to
rescue Leina, right?

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.660
So you've got to be willing to
take some drastic measures!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:21.120
You strap the bomb to your back and
attach yourself to their ships one by one!

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:23.420
And you ask, "Is Leina here?"

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:27.390
The bad guys won't be willing to attack you once
they realize you've got a bomb strapped to your back!

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:31.020
All right, let's do it!

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.340
We can always count on you, Judau!

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:33.900
You're our hero!

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.720
I'll go start getting ready!

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:39.220
We'll join you as soon as we're
done with our errands, hero!

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:42.440
He's still got that one-track mind.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:44.400
Soon, it'll be time for
a new main character.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.710
Right, right! The Double Zeta's not
coming back in one piece from this.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:51.620
And Judau's not gonna strut around
acting important forever.

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:56.320
Judau got fooled into launching
with a bomb on his back?

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:57.700
We have to let him know, quick!

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:59.670
Judau in trouble! Judau!

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:02.350
Iino, how's it looking over there?

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:04.090
I'll be done in a minute!

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:06.750
Iino! What are you doing!?

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.800
It's a new weapon for the Double Zeta!

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:10.210
What kind of weapon is it?

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:11.720
Honestly, I'm not sure myself.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:12.840
What?

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:15.400
Judau! What's this new weapon?

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:16.970
Transforming!

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:23.140
Judau!

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:24.530
Don't do it!

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.980
You two have mess duty!

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:27.980
But this isn't...

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:28.980
...the time for that!

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:30.530
Go on, get to work!

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.940
- Judau's in big trouble!
- Shinta, Qum, trouble! Judau in trouble!

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:34.070
- We're in trouble, too!
- Shinta, Qum, trouble! Judau in trouble!

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:38.330
Shinta, Qum, trouble!
Judau in trouble! In trouble!

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:48.000
We can stop scattering
Minovsky particles now.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:50.590
If the Argama comes for us,
we'll put an end to it.

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:54.560
Ma'am! I will have Rakan
Dahkaran launch immediately!

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:15.870
Rakan Dahkaran, launching!

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:24.450
Lieutenant Rakan's
Dreissen is launching!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.040
Is he moving to the Mindra?

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:27.420
Yes, sir!

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.280
Where is the enemy ship?

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:36.270
It seems they have not
entered our sector yet.

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:40.720
I shall bolster our fleet's
morale. Turn on the holoscope.

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:42.440
Ma'am!

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:50.610
To the glorious soldiers of Neo-Zeon!

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:55.200
Those who cast us into darkness
now lie beneath our feet.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:07:01.850
The time has come to show these
people just how foolish they are!

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:06.030
We will show them that Earth now
belongs to us, the Neo-Zeon!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:09.170
This is our time. Fight
together with me!

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:13.420
For Neo-Zeon! For the
glory of Neo-Zeon!

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:21.600
Long live Neo-Zeon!
Long live Lady Haman!

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:23.390
Is that Rakan's mobile suit?

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:25.640
Yes, that is the Dreissen.

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:29.360
How much will he make the Argama
suffer? I wish to see it.

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:44.060
We still don't have an exact
location for the enemy fleet?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.540
We should be entering combat range soon!

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:49.250
Prepare to launch mobile suits!

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:50.080
Roger!

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.750
Hold it!

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:54.920
Again? What did you two do this time?

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:55.920
It's not us!

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:57.960
Judau's in big trouble!

00:07:57.960 --> 00:07:58.550
Sheesh!

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.090
It's a bomb!

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:02.850
Judau is going to launch with bombs!

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:05.150
Bombs?!

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.680
Is that really true?

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:09.560
We've been saying it all along!

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:11.560
Enemy ships confirmed
in geosynchronous orbit!

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:13.520
Enemy ships confirmed
in geosynchronous orbit!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:17.140
- All hands, level 1 battle stations!
- You guys go back to your room!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:20.770
- All right, from here it's just a short flight away!
- All hands, level 1 battle stations!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.580
Judau! Where do you think you're
going without launch orders?!

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:28.580
Man, you caught me! Do
you see though everything?

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:30.410
I didn't get older
without getting wiser.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:33.510
Really? Then did you see this coming?

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.050
Well, too bad!

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:39.630
J-Judau! Are those hand grenades?!

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:41.980
Yup! Doesn't it look cool!?

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:43.800
It's the same stuff that's
on the Double Zeta!

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:47.740
W-What?! You mean, all those
containers are full of bombs?!

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:49.890
Right, so don't get in my way!

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:52.770
Judau, do you want to die?!

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.310
You can't go off--

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.410
What's wrong?

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:59.190
Iino! That new weapon...
it's nothing but bombs!

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:00.690
It's what?!

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:02.080
Cut the wires!

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:05.120
I'm on my way, Leina.... Hang in there!

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:09.620
Iino?!

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:12.130
I-I'm stuck! Help me!

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:18.840
Judau! It's no good!

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:20.720
Hey, Judau! Stop it!

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:22.770
I can't stop here now!

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:26.810
Iino! Grab a helmet!

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:28.930
Put a helmet on!

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:34.480
Apparently he has bombs strapped
both to his own body and Double Zeta!

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:35.770
To his own body?!

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:38.150
That's Judau for you!

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:39.740
What a guy!

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:42.150
Get back to work, you two!

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:43.660
Yes, sir!

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:46.030
Here goes!

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:49.240
Judau, stop it! A tactic
like that will never work!

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:51.670
We won't know that until I try!

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:56.050
Help me!

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:04.130
At this distance, I should
be okay even if it blows up!

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:07.680
Wait, who's that?

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:13.650
Iino!? Why is he...?!

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:18.950
Oh, no!

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:28.570
Iino! What are you doing down there?!

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:31.060
What's the meaning of this, Judau?!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.700
How could you do this to me?!

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:36.170
W-Wait a minute! What's that?

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:38.550
I-It's an enemy!

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:42.380
Look, I can't close the hatch
if you're dragging a tow line!

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:46.270
Are you kidding me?!
I'm not gonna die alone!

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:47.800
And you call yourself a man?!

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.180
That's beside the point!

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:50.810
Geez!

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:57.060
Was that the AEUG's new model...?!

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:59.810
Don't worry about it!
Our target is the Argama!

00:10:59.810 --> 00:11:00.730
Roger!

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.360
It's gone...

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:05.780
They're going to attack the
Argama! We should go back!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:07.370
I can't go back now!

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:12.620
Two bogeys,
probably mobile suits!

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.580
Launch the Mk. II and Zeta!

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:16.830
I still can't get a visual
of the main enemy fleet!

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:18.710
Prepare to fire the high mega-cannons!

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:20.920
Intercept them!

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:22.090
Yes, sir!

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:35.230
Don't fire until ordered!

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:39.760
Use the dummy asteroids, and
circle up above the Argama!

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:42.150
Make sure not to launch into enemy fire!

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:44.160
Easy for you to say!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.990
Roux Louka, moving out!

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:50.250
I can do this!

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:55.170
J-Judau!

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:58.620
There it is!

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.170
Hold on tight!

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:01.620
S-Sure....

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:23.020
Captain! It's the Double Zeta!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:25.440
What?! Launch mobile suits!

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:28.990
Outta my way! I'm carrying bombs!

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:34.990
He broke through our defensive line!

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.240
What the hell are our
mobile suits doing?!

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:42.120
Hey! Is Leina on this ship?!

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:45.290
If you don't fess up, I'm
going to crush the bridge!

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:48.520
Leina?! We have no such mobile suit!

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:49.880
Mobile suit?

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:51.420
Damn them!

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:55.020
If you do that, you're all going to die.

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:03.820
Damn you!

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:06.700
I'm going to shoot!

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:20.230
- AEUG mobile suit approaching from behind.
- This pressure...

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:22.850
It seems to be carrying an
immense amount of explosives.

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:25.010
It's that boy again.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:28.170
How interesting.

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:34.590
Lady Haman, the Double Zeta's pilot
seems to be searching for a person named Leina.

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:36.050
- Leina...?
- Yes.

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:38.180
You mean the girl in
Glemy Toto's custody?

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:39.710
Most likely.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.110
He's searching for
someone during a battle?

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:46.750
That boy... he may be an
entirely new breed of Newtype.

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:49.110
He's here! It's the Double Zeta!

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:51.030
What is our mobile-suit squad doing?!

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:52.560
His speed--

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:54.160
That's a new model!

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:57.620
Don't get so carried away, Double Zeta!

00:13:58.340 --> 00:13:59.910
What's wrong, Judau?

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:01.420
It's that woman's voice!

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.550
- Turn on the holoscope!
- Ma'am!

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:07.420
Huh?

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:09.220
W-What is that?!

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:12.170
The one you seek, Leina,
is on this ship!

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:14.090
It's Haman Karn...!

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:16.770
If you want her back,
come aboard and get her.

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.390
This is a trap!

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:20.990
You may choose not to believe me.

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:23.740
But if so, you will never
see Leina again.

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:27.230
Judau, don't do it! There's no way
she's really on that ship!

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:31.120
Shut up! I'm going in,
so tell me where to go!

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:33.480
Guide him!

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:35.080
- But...
- It is no matter.

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:50.920
Whoa! Any closer and
I'm detonating these!

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:53.640
And I wasn't piloting
this by myself, either!

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:56.310
It's that woman!

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:00.980
Lady Haman?!

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:06.730
Come!

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.540
J-Judau!

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:11.900
Don't move an inch!
And close the hatch!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:15.280
What are you standing there
for! Go protect Lady Haman!

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.580
Yes, sir!

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.950
If you do anything funny, I swear
I'll set off these grenades!

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:23.750
I am aware.

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:30.840
I just wanted to talk
to you alone, boy.

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:34.660
T-That's Judau! I'm Judau Ashta.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.260
Judau, huh?

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:40.890
I see... There seems to be some
sort of attraction between us.

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:46.140
When I saw you on the pre-deck,
I understood that very well.

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:50.930
Do you feel it, too? The awareness
that you and I are the same.

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:52.860
The same?

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:55.650
Don't tell me what to
think! Where is Leina?!

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:57.440
Leina isn't here.

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:58.860
You were lying?

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:00.990
You should already know that.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:05.490
You came aboard this ship because
you felt an attraction to me.

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:06.410
Am I wrong?

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:07.870
Y-You are!

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:13.180
As a Newtype, you should
feel the desire to obey me.

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:16.430
That's right, Judau Ashta.

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:20.090
This feels really weird,

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:22.470
but it kinda smells nice...

00:16:22.470 --> 00:16:25.730
This is bizarre... she's
the enemy, but...

00:16:26.490 --> 00:16:30.650
There is no reason for us
to oppose each other.

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:33.820
We are both Newtypes.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:38.160
You should come with me now...

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:40.360
There he is!

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:42.390
He's over here!

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:45.080
You.... you're the enemy!

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:46.580
Judau!

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:50.930
- What?!
- They're at two o'clock!

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:54.420
That battleship was behind an
asteroid, but now it's descending!

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:56.680
All cannons, at two o'clock!

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:58.220
How did you miss this?!

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:07.310
Lord Rakan! At this rate, we're
going to ram into the enemy ship!

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.850
That's what I'm ordering you to do!

00:17:09.030 --> 00:17:12.190
You can't be serious! This is crazy!

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:17.240
Anyone who leaves his station will be
executed as a traitor for deserting his post.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:25.460
Captain! Even if we sink the enemy ship,
at this range it's going to damage the Argama!

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:28.960
Full speed to flank and continue
firing all hyper mega-cannons!

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:31.410
A-Are you trying to get us killed?!

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:34.380
Man your station, Beecha!

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:39.970
Go! Continue diving at this angle!

00:17:41.110 --> 00:17:44.080
It's no good, Captain! We
won't make it in time!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.350
Fire the high mega-cannons!

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.570
Hold position!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:02.490
What's wrong?

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:05.700
T-The ship is off course
now due to enemy fire!

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:13.300
Just as I'd expect from the famed
Argama! The rumors did not exaggerate.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:17.210
Lord Rakan! We've gotten word that the
Double Zeta has infiltrated the Sadalahn!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:21.050
What?! Pull back. We'll
rendezvous with the main fleet.

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:23.720
I'll go ahead in the Dreissen!

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:26.230
There he is!

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:29.600
Is it this way?!

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:31.510
He's over here!

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:32.770
Haman?!

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:35.600
Judau Ashta... listen to me!

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:38.060
Lady Haman! Please step aside!

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:38.980
Wait!

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:43.070
I'm glad you're covering for me,
lady, but you're way too scary.

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:44.620
Judau!

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:46.910
Iino!

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:55.130
Double Zeta!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:57.130
You...

00:18:57.560 --> 00:18:59.290
A bomb?!

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.520
Judau!

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:08.020
Iino! Over here! We're
getting outta here!

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:11.970
Where's Leina?

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:13.560
It was a lie after all!

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.590
We'll use the bombs to
blow the airlock.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.850
Wha? The bombs are gone!

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:20.240
What were you doing here, spacing out?!

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:22.200
If that's the case...

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.320
Let's go, Iino!

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:30.830
Okay!

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:39.170
Judau Ashta... the
Argama's Newtype.

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:43.710
Whew, we managed to get out of there...

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:44.670
Yeah.

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:47.010
What is it?!

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:50.940
Double Zeta, I was waiting for you!

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:53.100
Wow, they've got some serious defenses!

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:54.900
I know that!

00:19:58.620 --> 00:19:59.820
S-So fast!

00:20:03.980 --> 00:20:05.990
S-So strong!

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:10.950
Not bad!

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:12.030
Out of my way!

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:13.660
I won't!

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:14.830
What?!

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:16.840
Can you dodge this?!

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:28.440
Where... where did he go?

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:30.420
You lose, Double Zeta!

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:31.930
What?!

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:37.230
W-What?!

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:43.270
Judau! Are you okay?!

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:44.860
This is pathetic!

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:49.280
It's not over yet!

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:51.540
Know when to quit!

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:56.420
Fall back!

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:05.090
I won't forget this, Double Zeta!

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:12.630
Did we do it?

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:14.940
Yeah... we drove off the
mobile suit, at least.

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:17.180
So, was Leina there?

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:19.350
No, she wasn't.

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:20.890
I see.

00:21:20.890 --> 00:21:26.660
I swear... I swear I'll find out where
you are! Wait for me, Leina!

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:45.270
Right! One, two, three! One,
two, three! One, two, three!

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:48.880
Now, lower your leg... You're
pretty good at this!

00:21:53.650 --> 00:21:56.550
The Argama... it looks like
it took quite a beating.

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:59.150
The captain.... he's
gotta be really pissed.

00:22:02.450 --> 00:22:03.730
Are they back?

00:22:03.730 --> 00:22:04.940
Think about what you did!

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:07.560
What are you talking about! It was
because we gave him the bombs...

00:22:07.560 --> 00:22:09.820
that Judau was able to survive!

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:12.610
The ends don't justify the means!
If Iino had been the only one there...

00:22:12.610 --> 00:22:15.150
- Yeah, if Judau hadn't been there, the
Double Zeta would've been destroyed!

00:22:15.150 --> 00:22:16.410
- Judau, huh...
- Yeah, if Judau hadn't been there, the Double Zeta would've been destroyed!

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:17.990
It's just like Shinta says.

00:22:18.170 --> 00:22:23.590
Else, there is no way that both of them
could've returned from the enemy ship alive.

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:47.450 --> 00:23:50.900
Haman's fleet hasn't
landed on Earth yet.

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:54.070
They were just stalling while they
finalized their invasion plans!

00:23:54.070 --> 00:23:59.160
Since Bright's a straightforward guy, he
wants to use the Argama to sink the Sadalahn.

00:23:59.160 --> 00:24:03.200
But fighting while you're beginning
re-entry is pretty rough!

00:24:03.200 --> 00:24:05.620
Dammit, even Ple is here?!

00:24:05.620 --> 00:24:06.160
Next time on Gundam ZZ: "Burning Earth."

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:09.290
Next Time

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:09.290
BURNING EARTH

00:24:09.540 --> 00:24:11.840
Ple, don't leave my side!
